# {version}

Additional documentation can be found at: https://github.com/abrisco/rules_doxygen

## Setup

```python
http_archive = use_repo_rule("@bazel_tools//tools/build_defs/repo:http.bzl", "http_archive")

http_archive(
    name = "rules_doxygen",
    integrity = "sha256-{sha256_base64}",
    urls = ["https://github.com/abrisco/rules_doxygen/releases/download/{version}/rules_doxygen-{version}.tar.gz"],
)

register_toolchains(
    "@rules_doxygen//doxygen/toolchain",
)
```
